Package: bladerf-firmware-fx3
Section: comm
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: bladerf
Suggests: bladerf-fpga
Provides: bladerf-firmware
Description: Nuand bladeRF firmware downloader (FX3)
 This package contains a version-pinned firmware image for the Nuand
 bladeRF Cypress FX3 USB controller, installed at /usr/share/Nuand/bladeRF.
 .
 This bitstream will work for either the Nuand bladeRF x40 or the x115,
 as well as the bladeRF 2.0 Micro xA4 or xA5 or xA9.
 .
 Note that this will not upgrade the bladeRF itself.  That can be done
 with the bladeRF-cli utility.

Package: python3-bladerf
Section: python
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, python3-cffi, libbladerf2
Description: Python 3 bindings for the Nuand bladeRF
 This package provides the CFFI-based Python 3 bindings and bladerf-tool
 command-line utility for libbladeRF.

Package: bladerf-matlab
Section: comm
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: MATLAB bindings and examples for the Nuand bladeRF
 This package provides the MATLAB/Octave binding source, examples, and
 tests. A compatible MATLAB or Octave runtime is not included.
